name: plan-fix
description: Plan fixes for the open feedback on a {{backend.displayName}} ticket's PR — failing CI checks, unresolved review comments, change requests, merge conflicts — by triaging findings, asking which to fix, and recording a test-driven execution plan for review-plan and execute-fix. Planning only; does not apply fixes. PR-only. Use when the user wants to act on review comments or fix a red/blocked PR — e.g. "fix the review comments on {{eg.prefixUpper}}-312", "address the PR feedback", "fix the failing CI", "fix {{eg.prefixUpper}}-312".
argument-hint: "{{eg.prefixUpper}}-NNN"
